      "mode": 0,
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "widgets_values": ["BSAI H3 4K SelfLift + Turbo v4 工作流\n\n核心技术（来自B站教程 BV16SJ96TEXF）：\n1. SelfLift Progressive Sampler：前6步低分辨率(0.5x)快速构图，后24步全分辨率细化纹理\n2. Turbo v4 LoRA：加速+去油化\n3. DLSS5：可选后处理超采样到4K（接在VAEDecode后）\n\n关键参数：\n- transition_step=6: 低分辨率步数（总30步中前6步）\n- lowres_scale=0.5: 低分辨率比例\n- rho=0.0: 使用外部H3 latent upscaler (learned lift)\n- upscaler_model=h3_upscaler_lms_v0.1_fp32.safetensors\n- cfg=5.0, 30步, euler\n- 分辨率1344x768, 124帧(~5s@24fps)\n\n可选：SelfLiftH3TST节点patch model提升时序稳定\n可选：DLSS5EnhanceImages接IMAGE输出做4K超采样"]
    }
  ],
